    {
      "id": "p0134-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "However, because \"Pa pico\" is a trademarked name in Japan, the translator chose a parody name rather than a direct reference. Thus the original \"Bisicle\" and \"Unisicle\" items are known as the \"Babico\" and \"Single Babico\" in Japanese.",
        "raw": "However, because \"Pa pico\" is a trademarked name in Japan, the translator chose\na parody name rather than a direct reference. Thus the original \"Bisicle\" and\n\"Unisicle\" items are known as the \"Babico\" and \"Single Babico\" in Japanese.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29054536,
          0.84303571,
          0.90469617,
          0.89272143
        ],
